# Keep ./models/ in the repo so a git clone materializes it owned by the cloning
# operator (uid 1000), NOT auto-created root:root by rootful dockerd (phaze-he8m).
# It is the DEFAULT bind source (`${MODELS_PATH:-./models}`) only; phaze never
# downloads weights into it (phaze-ynv6w). Point MODELS_PATH at the consolidated
# model directory, or provision this one with `just download-models models`.
